Template: locales/locales_to_be_generated
Type: multiselect
Choices: All locales, ${locales}
Description: Locales to be generated:
 Choose which locales this system should generate. UTF-8 locales are usually
 the right default for new installations.

Template: locales/default_environment_locale
Type: select
Choices: None, C.UTF-8, ${locales}
Default: None
Description: Default locale for the system environment:
 Choose the default locale exported for system-wide services and login
 sessions.
